;; .audio/ holds BOTH the CACAO private key (identity.edn, never commit)
;; AND ephemeral loop lease/state files — neither belongs in git.
;; ledger/events.edn itself IS the audit trail and is intentionally
;; NOT ignored (plain git text2git, see audio.ledger's docstring).
.audio/
.cpcache/
target/
.clj-kondo/.cache/
*.class
